    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587-a1">

                <pb facs="0690" n="594" xml:id="pg594"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bornholdt to Mr. Peirce.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-11-15"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 15,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Georgios I</hi>, belonging to the United Steamship
                    Company, of Copenhagen, was dispatched from here to Boston, Mass., and New York,
                    on Tuesday, the 8th instant, as first steamer of the new line between the
                    Russian Baltic ports and theUnited States.</p>
                <p>The second sailing is intended to take place about the end of this or beginning
                    of next month, if sufficient cargo turns up, and for that trip the steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alexandra</hi>, belonging to the same company, has been
                    taken in view.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. P. Bornholt</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
